            "type": "game",
            "name": "Scuffle Scoundrels",
            "steam_appid": 689120,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>LET'S SCUFFLE</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689120/extras/860e2a55a9a9dedb4f4bde849726e6a9.avif?t=1680511314\" width=600 height=140 /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A 2-minutes free-for-all mode - hectic, scallywagging action!</strong><br></li><li><strong>A sudden death tiebreaker for settling the score</strong><br></li><li><strong>4 dazzling captains, each commandeering their own unique ship</strong><br></li><li><strong>3 hazardous obstacles and 3 potent powerups pop up at the worst/best times</strong><br></li><li><strong>A swashbuckling original soundtrack by composer Morten Gildberg</strong></li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689120/extras/7b1fff20290a283e5d2fc63f8f3bc096.avif?t=1680511314\" width=600 height=274 /></span><br><br><strong>MEET THE SCOUNDRELS</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Green captain Haima, noble heir to a once mighty pirate dynasty</strong><br></li><li><strong>Purple captain Ngisi, mysterious hunter of relics and powers from beyond this realm</strong><br></li><li><strong>Red captain Aldha, smarmy and wealthy pirate merchant</strong><br></li><li><strong>Yellow captain Leowin, a fierce renegade admiral, proud and majestic</strong></li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689120/extras/832fcd40c08266136711acc2a98c3732.avif?t=1680511314\" width=600 height=117 /></span><br><br><strong>BEWARE THE DANGERS OF THE SEA</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Seaweeds slow you way down, leaving you a sitting duck to your competitors</strong><br></li><li><strong>Mines blow you to smithereens on impact</strong><br></li><li><strong>A giant maelstrom sends you on a whirling voyage to the bottom of the ocean</strong></li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689120/extras/d00ffddfbb0a93e4e007fcf782e28fc7.avif?t=1680511314\" width=600 height=127 /></span><br><br><strong>GRAB TREASURE CHESTS TO LOAD UP</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explosive cannon balls launch a devastating shockwave on impact, even when landing in water</strong><br></li><li><strong>Rapidfire cannon balls let you hold the fire button to launch projectiles at a terrifying pace</strong><br></li><li><strong>Chainshot cannon balls fan out to hit a larger area, assisting your aim greatly</strong></li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689120/extras/60aea508d4fdeebb9c70f222fbab4195.avif?t=1680511314\" width=600 height=307 /></span></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689120/extras/e739ca61c5f8981bddc04fb5170d7be8.avif?t=1680511314\" width=600 height=176 /></span><br><br>Scuffle Scoundrels is an arcade brawler for 2-to-4 rival captains of all ages.<br>As you can only fire from your broadsides in this game, you must flank your friends or family members to let them taste the hot end of your cannon. <br><br>It's a toony explosion of colorful fun, with devastating powerups, deadly hazards, and whimsical captains from all four corners of the world.<br><br>The game is playable with all fully PC-compatible controllers, though we currently recommend the X-Box variety.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689120/extras/7b1fff20290a283e5d2fc63f8f3bc096.avif?t=1680511314\" width=600 height=274 /></span>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689120/extras/e739ca61c5f8981bddc04fb5170d7be8.avif?t=1680511314\" width=600 height=176 /></span><br><br>Scuffle Scoundrels is an arcade brawler for 2-to-4 rival captains of all ages.<br>As you can only fire from your broadsides in this game, you must flank your friends or family members to let them taste the hot end of your cannon. <br><br>It's a toony explosion of colorful fun, with devastating powerups, deadly hazards, and whimsical captains from all four corners of the world.<br><br>The game is playable with all fully PC-compatible controllers, though we currently recommend the X-Box variety.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689120/extras/7b1fff20290a283e5d2fc63f8f3bc096.avif?t=1680511314\" width=600 height=274 /></span>",
            "short_description": "Scuffle Scoundrels is an oldschool arcade brawler for 2-to-4 rivals of all ages. With explosive powerups, deadly hazards, and imposing animal captains, it's sink or be sunk in this fast paced pirate romp!",
